[0m[49m[38;5;10m+      110[0m:[38;5;10m[49m terminal slave with `Stdio::from_raw_fd(slave_fd)` — which transfers ownership,
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+      111[0m:[38;5;10m[49m so `spawn` closes the parent's copy — and then called `close(slave_fd)` by hand
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+      112[0m:[38;5;10m[49m as well. That second close targets a descriptor *number* that the runtime is
